  "content": "<h4>&nbsp;</h4><h4><strong>🌊 海綿工藝 GUI 🌊 1.20-Latest</strong></h4><p><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/1332848/description_49816912-f554-4b53-89f3-e5d2515249b4.png\" width=\"834\" height=\"556\"></p><p>透過這個<strong>完全自訂的 GUI 包</strong>，將<strong>海綿寶寶的世界</strong>帶入 Minecraft！</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p><strong>全新功能！</strong></p><p><strong>新增派大星圖騰！</strong></p><ul>\n<li><strong>將不死圖騰重新命名為「派大星」</strong></li>\n<li><strong>啟用時也會顯示效果！</strong></li>\n</ul><p>&nbsp;</p><h3><img style=\"font-size:16px\" src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/1332848/description_076a1601-195f-4425-8d85-1fc3e682d707.png\" width=\"145\" height=\"158\"></h3><h3>&nbsp;</h3><h3>&nbsp;</h3><h3>✨ 特色功能</h3><p>---------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------</p><p><strong>🪼 水母血量條</strong> – 將你的愛心替換成發光的水母，在血量條上漂浮。</p><p><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/null/description_8d20b115-7228-4bf6-b6d8-8695556d8054.png\"></p><p><strong>🍔 蟹黃堡飢餓條</strong> – 忘記雞腿吧！用美味的蟹黃堡填飽肚子！</p><p><strong><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/null/description_2cf198a1-d311-41e3-bcfa-b9dcbb8b44ce.png\"></strong></p><div>\n<div>\n<div title=\"🐌 蝸牛表情符號 | 含義、複製與貼上\">🐌&nbsp;<strong>小蝸盔甲條 -&nbsp;</strong>讓你的最佳夥伴隨時保護你！</div>\n<div title=\"🐌 蝸牛表情符號 | 含義、複製與貼上\">&nbsp;</div>\n<div title=\"🐌 蝸牛表情符號 | 含義、複製與貼上\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/null/description_8f6b55c1-5adc-4392-9acf-ca76edd05ad3.png\"></div>\n<div title=\"🐌 蝸牛表情符號 | 含義、複製與貼上\">&nbsp;</div>\n<div title=\"🐌 蝸牛表情符號 | 含義、複製與貼上\">&nbsp;</div>\n</div>\n</div><p><strong>🪙 蟹老闆金幣用於寵物與馬匹血量</strong> – 寵物和馬現在以寶藏取代愛心來維持生命。</p><p><strong><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/1332848/description_7820e718-4553-4bae-a9b8-1dd60ce90216.png\"></strong></p><p><strong>⚙️ 海洋主題 GUI 按鈕 &amp; 背包！</strong> – 選單以流暢的水藍漸層、泡泡和波浪效果生動呈現。</p><p><strong><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/null/description_867915cf-9bbd-40fe-b306-eac8a511cd73.png\" width=\"338\" height=\"229\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/1332848/description_30dc1b84-0bb0-44dc-8e31-5a8463fc290d.png\" width=\"247\" height=\"232\"></strong></p><p><strong>🎮 將快捷欄變為海綿寶寶的水母網</strong> – 以有趣的客製網狀快捷欄來拿取物品。</p><p><strong><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/null/description_2ef80c3b-5c4c-4e70-aa87-0b505c2002b9.png\"></strong></p><p>-------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------</p><h3>📦 相容性</h3><p>✅ 相容於 Minecraft <strong>1.20-Latest</strong><br>⚡ 為流暢遊戲體驗完全最佳化</p><p><strong>我的其他作品&nbsp;</strong></p><div>\n<p><strong>&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp;</strong></p>\n</div><p><strong><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/texture-packs/pochacco-hotbar-gui\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/1332848/description_46a76311-2a63-459c-ba65-e6ce60f17097.png\" width=\"145\" height=\"145\"></a><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/texture-packs/the-undying-cat\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/1332848/description_bcf8062b-7a11-4d89-ad7a-ada570c6f4b0.png\"></a></strong></p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>&nbsp;</p>",
